<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <!-- Vanilla Psycasts Expanded (workshop 2842502659), Frostshaper "Cold zone" (VPE_ColdZone). Personal tweak.
       1. Enemy psycasters cast nothing but Cold zone. VEF's Pawn.TryGetAttackVerb postfix hands NPCs the longest-range
          autocastable ability whenever the AI asks for an attack verb without a target, and Cold zone (range 62.9) is
          the longest of all combat psycasts, so every Frostshaper recasts it and several stack it on one spot.
          chance 0 takes it out of NPC autocasting (CanAutoCast needs chance > 0); colonists can still cast it by hand,
          only its autocast toggle goes.
       2. Each zone throws about 0.28 glow flecks per tick, each 9-14 tiles wide, additive (MoteGlow) and drawn above
          pawns (MoteOverhead): one zone is a bright haze, stacked zones a white-out hiding the colonists. The glow
          gets half alpha and is drawn on the ground (MoteLow), under buildings, items and pawns.
       The PatchOperationTest steps fail with a red patch error when VPE renames the def or fleck. -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationSequence" MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VPsycastsE">
    <operations>
      <li Class="PatchOperationTest">
        <xpath>Defs/*[defName="VPE_ColdZone"]/modExtensions/li[fleckToSpawnInArea="VPE_ColdGlow"]</xpath>
      </li>
      <li Class="PatchOperationTest">
        <xpath>Defs/FleckDef[defName="VPE_ColdGlow"]/altitudeLayer</xpath>
      </li>
      <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
        <xpath>Defs/*[defName="VPE_ColdZone"]/chance</xpath>
        <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/*[defName="VPE_ColdZone"]/chance</xpath>
          <value><chance>0</chance></value>
        </match>
        <nomatch Class="PatchOperationAdd">
          <xpath>Defs/*[defName="VPE_ColdZone"]</xpath>
          <value><chance>0</chance></value>
        </nomatch>
      </li>
      <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
        <xpath>Defs/FleckDef[defName="VPE_ColdGlow"]/altitudeLayer</xpath>
        <value><altitudeLayer>MoteLow</altitudeLayer></value>
      </li>
      <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>Defs/FleckDef[defName="VPE_ColdGlow"]/graphicData</xpath>
        <value><color>(1, 1, 1, 0.5)</color></value>
      </li>
    </operations>
  </Operation>
</Patch>
